{#-
  Tells somebody that an assessment they passed is due to be repeated.
  Sent once, when the pass reaches the age the module gives. Context:
    name          who to greet: their full name, or their username where
                  the account has none
    module_title  the module they passed
    passed_on     the date they passed, written out: "1 June 2027"
    module_url    the link to the module in Quill
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}Your assessment is due to be repeated: {{ module_title }}{% endblock subject %}
{% block preheader %}You passed on {{ passed_on }}.{% endblock preheader %}
{% block body %}
{{ c.heading("Time to *repeat* your assessment") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Hi " ~ name ~ ",") }}
{% call c.paragraph() %}You passed <strong>{{ module_title }}</strong> on {{ passed_on }}. That assessment is now due to be repeated.{% endcall %}
{{ c.button("Open the module", module_url) }}
{{ c.small("Your earlier result and certificate stay on your record.") }}
{% endblock body %}
{% block reason %}You are receiving this because you passed this module's assessment in Quill.{% endblock reason %}

{% block text %}
Hi {{ name }},

You passed {{ module_title }} on {{ passed_on }}. That assessment is now due to be repeated.

Open the module: {{ module_url }}

Your earlier result and certificate stay on your record.
{% endblock text %}
